{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/1243adccff381895a786b3c4447cb4a9.poster.avif?t=1660419451\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/1243adccff381895a786b3c4447cb4a9.webm?t=1660419451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/1243adccff381895a786b3c4447cb4a9.mp4?t=1660419451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get out of your base, get out of the comfort zone.</h2></strong><br>Face other opponents inside a unknow labyrinth. Follow the path to nowhere or destroy the walls to give a end for your enemies. Path of Destruction is a round based game, every round you have a opportunity to purchase and sell items before going to the action. Move around gathering items, exploding dynamites, throwing grenades or just shot at the wall, the rule is never stand in the same place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/83f4149b93ef7ff829018e3671e5ccf7.poster.avif?t=1660419451\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/83f4149b93ef7ff829018e3671e5ccf7.webm?t=1660419451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/83f4149b93ef7ff829018e3671e5ccf7.mp4?t=1660419451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adquire powerful weapons and bring destruction to the game.</h2></strong><br>We have a few available weapons now:<br> - Glock (Pistol) | Ak47 (Rifle) | M4A1 (Rifle) | MP249 (Heavy Machine Gun) | Katana 