amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/a6930975b055e2a8d2abb17af50b4144.poster.avif?t=1660419451\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/a6930975b055e2a8d2abb17af50b4144.webm?t=1660419451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/a6930975b055e2a8d2abb17af50b4144.mp4?t=1660419451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fool your friends with fake items.</h2></strong><br>You can have 3 different specials at the same time, each special can be used two times (once an upgrade is bought). There are a few types of specials in the game right now:<br> - Back To Base | Fake Item | Cluster Bomb | Pain Reflection | Master Key | Ghost | Invisible Bullets | Remote Controlled Bomb | First Aid Kit | Projectiles Ignore Walls | Missile Attack | Brightness | Bomber","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1918080?t=1660419451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1918080?t=1660419451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1660419451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1660419451","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/1243adccff381895a786b3c4447cb4a9.poster.avif?t=1660419451\" width=630 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918080/extras/1243adccff38